msgid "<p>The Editoria11y <strong><em>@type</em></strong> view is missing.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>The Editoria11y <strong><em>@type</em></strong> view is missing.</p><p>De "
"Editoria11y‑weergave <strong><em>@type</em></strong> ontbreekt.</p>"

msgid ""
"<p>There are three view configurations this module installs, found in its /"
"config/install folder. Each must be installed for this dashboard to display "
"results.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>There are three view configurations this module installs, found in its /"
"config/install folder. Each must be installed for this dashboard to display "
"results.</p><p>Deze module installeert drie view‑configuraties in de map /"
"config/install. Alle drie moeten geïnstalleerd zijn om resultaten in het "
"dashboard te tonen.</p>"

msgid ""
"<p>To fix: copy and paste the contents of <strong>/editoria11y/config/"
"install/views.view.ed11y_@type.yml</strong> into a \"View\" type import at "
"<a href=\"/admin/config/development/configuration/single/import\">/admin/"
"config/development/configuration/single/import</a>. If you sync your "
"configuration to the filesystem, be sure to include these Views in your "
"repository.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>To fix: copy and paste the contents of <strong>/editoria11y/config/"
"install/views.view.ed11y_@type.yml</strong> into a \"View\" type import at "
"<a href=\"/admin/config/development/configuration/single/import\">/admin/"
"config/development/configuration/single/import</a>. If you sync your "
"configuration to the filesystem, be sure to include these Views in your "
"repository.</p><p>Oplossing: kopieer de inhoud van <strong>/editoria11y/"
"config/install/views.view.ed11y_@type.yml</strong> en plak deze in een "
"import van het type “View” op <a href=\"/admin/config/development/"
"configuration/single/import\">/admin/config/development/configuration/single/"
"import</a>. Als configuratie wordt gesynchroniseerd met het bestandssysteem, "
"zorg dan dat deze views in de repository zijn opgenomen.</p>"

